# VT-119 load/risk experiment — 150 concurrent export tasks, target p95 <= 4.0 s
# harness : scripts/vt119_export_load.py (httpx, 150 concurrent x 5 rounds = 750 requests, 1 warm-up)
# server  : uvicorn app.main:app, 1 worker (as in backend/Dockerfile), PostgreSQL 16 local, same host
# data    : 1984 rows (1488 booked + 496 cancelled), export window 31 days (max allowed), 176,340-byte CSV
# host    : sandbox with nproc=1 -> load client, API and PostgreSQL share ONE vCPU (pessimistic)
# date    : 2026-11-01T14:04:06Z

